<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Arial', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>07 · RESULTS (4/6) — H2</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        The slope is negative — but Λ never halves
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36, marginTop: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 620, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                ALTERNATING COPOLYMER · 5 FOLDS · THE SLOPE OF THIS CURVE
            </Text>
            <Chart
                style={{ width: 620, height: 274, marginTop: 6 }}
                chartType='lineChart'
                grouping='clustered'
                colors={['#4D8DFF']}
                background='#0E1728'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={false}
                axisColor='#A8B8CE'
                dataLabelColor='#FFFFFF'
                data={[
                    ['training rows', 'Λ'],
                    ['300', 0.2946],
                    ['1,000', 0.5029],
                    ['3,000', 0.3675],
                    ['10,000', 0.2785],
                    ['all', 0.1915],
                ]}
            />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C3D0E2', marginTop: 8 }}>
                Λ by training rows: 0.295 → 0.503 → 0.368 → 0.279 → 0.192
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                Slope = univariate OLS of Λ on log10(rows), fitted per fold and then averaged.
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF6B6B', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>−0.086</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>slope κ, 95% interval [−0.105, −0.067] — entirely below zero</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFB020', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>0.650</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Λ at the largest n ÷ Λ at the smallest — needs &lt; 0.5 to halve</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                H2 needs <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>both</span>: a significantly negative slope and a halved Λ.
                The first holds, the second does not — so H2 is <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>not refuted</span>.
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#A8B8CE', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                The shape is a hump, not a line: Λ <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>rises</span> to the 1,000-row peak
                at +0.398/dex, then falls — −0.284/dex to 3,000, −0.202/dex after. The negative sign lives in the tail.
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        {[
            ['PRE-REGISTERED', '−0.086 / 0.650', 'slope κ and ratio · all 5 levels'],
            ['DROP SMALLEST LEVEL', '−0.224', 'slope κ — sign holds'],
            ['TWO STABLE LEVELS ONLY', '+0.398', 'slope κ, 300→1,000 — sign flips'],
            ['PEAK-START RATIO (POST HOC)', '0.380', 'a ratio, not a slope — would refute; unused'],
        ].map(([label, value, note]) => (
            <Box key={label} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '10px 14px', background: '#111B2E', border: '1px solid #24334C', borderRadius: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 0.8 }}>{label}</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>{value}</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 2, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>{note}</Text>
            </Box>
        ))}
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>
            0.380 = Λ_all ÷ Λ_peak = 0.1915 / 0.5029 (a ratio, not a slope). Homopolymer: no slope — its top two levels are 0.158 dex apart.
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>11 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
